<h2 class="g-h2" id="behaviour">Behaviour</h2>
<div class="g-prose">
  <p>Each row is a facet: following it narrows the list by that part and keeps the others (a tier and a court together), and following it again removes it. The narrowing in force is marked on the panel by <code>narrowPanel</code> (<code>opinion_views.js</code>), which listens for the <code>citator-narrow</code> event the list sends.</p>
  <p><em>Citator summary</em> returns the panel to the opinion's summary on the opinion page.</p>
</div>

